<http://data.silknow.org/object/03728a34-94b5-3da9-b99b-98994fc7d4ef/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Rayon commemorative scarf features, radiating out from the center, a cardinal directions compass with helmeted head and string of banners in a roundel of yellow, blue loosely sketched clouds, structures from the festival, light blue-turquoise border. \"Festival of Britain 1951\" rounds the compass in cursive. Four of the structures are named in the scarf's corners, reading: \"Shot Tower\", \"Sky Pointer\", Royal Festival Hall\", and \"Pavillion 1851\". Besides yellow, blue and red are used sparingly. No label."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/03728a34-94b5-3da9-b99b-98994fc7d4ef> .

